      "bytes": 365580,
      "seconds": 4.144,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_millsage_004_1_03_088.wav",
      "subtitle": "我说，那边那个女生。\n这里非工作人员禁止入内哦"
    },
    {
      "slug": "nagi",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "nagi",
      "speakerId": "adv_nagi",
      "text": "……朋花。你这就要回去了？",
