      "index": 477,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_071.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_071",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "0980ce0a75a99c8eb05e9fb91610931303b7e4a89f6ee030b428d3dc86dab626",
      "nativeSha256": "dd577b9a9f1e45591f0f2d118d3ff7cd2d04d73717cc350c45d8b0dfcb140453",
      "bytes": 229752,
      "seconds": 2.604,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_071.wav",
      "subtitle": "这次再怎么说都是奏多的错吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "nagi",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "nagi",
      "speakerId": "adv_nagi",
      "text": "嗯。以前是我姐练篮球用的……\n现在没人用了",
      "textId": "adv_script_millsage_004_1_04_119",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10063",
      "index": 811,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_117.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_117",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "e7c75dcf83c2b5eb2e16f5e788024b1360a1ebfe4d27316ec6e2e58807693869",
      "nativeSha256": "159fb7ef3a56e84d1636645a0db390f0655bdd43fa8bf208d261f3c775e70f12",
      "bytes": 587136,
      "seconds": 6.656,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_millsage_004_1_04_117.wav",
      "subtitle": "嗯。以前是我姐练篮球用的……\n现在没人用了"
    },
    {
      "slug": "nagi",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "nagi",
      "speakerId": "adv_nagi",
      "text": "听完刚才那段，\n再不让汐见同学唱就太浪费了吧",
      "textId": "adv_script_millsage_004_1_14_108",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10073",
      "index": 801,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_14/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_14_103.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_millsage_004_1_14_103",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "92c1ab4015dc30e013092cd825f96cc55d2ac9412d6f7cfc5fb6ce28824b7a1a",
      "nativeSha256": "9e0c940c536129b89477c98a07da7ba2e11538061e58f6e5a16221aa2fd64f84",
      "bytes": 357466,
      "seconds": 4.052,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_millsage_004_1_14_103.wav",
      "subtitle": "听完刚才那段，\n再不让汐见同学唱就太浪费了吧"
    },
    {
      "slug": "nagi",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "nagi",
      "speakerId": "adv_nagi",
      "text": "……你是茉幌的麻烦粉丝？\n如果是这样的话，我可不能让你见她呢",
      "textId": "adv_script_millsage_004_1_03_95",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10062",
      "index": 505,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_03/adv_voice_millsage_004_1_03_091.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_millsage_004_1_03_091",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "ca6add1654e92ae1e8b6446f79cfc6c75b6e7bd01a803aeeac6a1d5d1c3c24ba",
      "nativeSha256": "eec760cdc1e74e51c8ce7901812d38d1ee17dd92b50ec8e4b6263603be5a64fd",
      "bytes": 491506,
      "seconds": 5.572,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_millsage_004_1_03_091.wav",
      "subtitle": "……你是茉幌的麻烦粉丝？\n如果是这样的话，我可不能让你见她呢"
    },
    {
      "slug": "nagi",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "nagi",
      "speakerId": "adv_nagi",
      "text": "……啊，想起来了。\n她就是传闻里那个霸占着天台、谁都不让靠近的学姐",
